  "name": "Dimethyl sulfide Distribution data - Line P to Station Papa, 1997-present",
  "description": "Profiles of dimethyl sulfide distribution in the water column along Line P to Station Papa.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: Estimating production of dimethyl sulfide in the ocean.\n\nSupplemental information: Risk Justification: Custodian will be leaving soon and has a large quantity of data not secured in a regional data centre. Risk of Loss: High Impact Justification: Data are related to a subject, location or species of concern within the scientific, government or public community within the last 5 years. Impact of Loss: Medium Recommended Action: Obtain access from Dr. Wong and bring data to archives. Additional Info: Data are part of the Ocean Climate program.",
